Package: restreamer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yoonji Park <koreapyj0@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, adduser
Section: video
Priority: optional
Description: HLS restreaming daemon for tvheadend hosts (tvh-controller)
 Supervises source -> tsreadex -> ffmpeg encoding sessions that turn local
 tvheadend channels into browser-playable HLS under serveDir, controlled by
 tvh-controller pushing desired-state documents over an unauthenticated,
 LAN-isolated HTTP API. Desired state is persisted locally, so sessions
 survive controller outages and daemon restarts.
 .
 Self-contained: bundles its own Node.js runtime under
 /usr/lib/restreamer/runtime (hence Architecture: amd64); no system Node.js
 is required. ffmpeg and tsreadex are NOT bundled and must be provided by
 the host. The repo's second deployable (the switcher) is not part of this
 package; it ships as a container image (deploy/switcher.Dockerfile).
